any sense.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.620
Right.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.490
That house that he was talking about wasn't
founded for another 400 years.

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:32.960
Vlad the Impaler was not the progenitor of
all European dynasties, etc..

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.310
So from a historical standpoint, it makes
no sense.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:37.570
Speaker 1: Yeah, I got an email about that.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.001
