of the people.

00:04:26.669 --> 00:04:28.240
Think about abortion rights.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:32.419
The will of the people is overwhelmingly that
abortion be legal in most cases.

00:04:32.419 --> 00:04:36.120
If you look at the Senate, that's not the
view in the Senate of the 100 senators.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.020
So we've got a real problem there.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:39.430
We don't really have representation.

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:41.479
Speaker 2: Right.

00:04:41.479 --> 00:04:44.349
