screwed the species or whatever.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:28.669
I think that if we don't bring some people
in who maybe could be problem solvers, we

00:05:28.669 --> 00:05:29.810
have no shot.

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:33.199
You miss 100% of the shots you don't take.

00:05:33.199 --> 00:05:34.199
Yeah.

00:05:34.199 --> 00:05:36.820
And so I want to have a shot at it.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:40.469
And so I want to bring someone in who maybe
could be someone that find solutions.

00:05:40.469 --> 00:05:41.469
Speaker 2: Yeah.

00:05:41.469 --> 00:05:42.469
Well, thank you so much, David.

00:05:42.469 --> 00:05:43.469
Speaker 1: All right.

00:05:43.469 --> 00:05:46.090
